  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Drop the anchor! You've found your next vacation home...<br><br>This stunning 5-bedroom vacation home is perfect for families of all sizes!<br><br>With three adult bedrooms (king size bed in each), one children's bedroom (with two full beds) PLUS a bonus bunk space. Four full bathrooms, with each bedroom getting its own dedicated bathroom.<br><br>The house, located in the private Magnolia Dune community, is just a short 5-minute walk away from the beach, less than two miles from Seaside's restaurants and food trucks and is centrally located on 30A!<br><br>Amenities include:<br><br>- 6-seater golf cart included<br>- 4 bikes (w/ locks) included<br>- 6 backpack beach chairs, 3 beach umbrellas, beach toys/games and beach wagon included<br>- high-speed wifi internet<br>- smart TVs in all bedrooms and living room for streaming<br>- community pool access (located right behind the house)<br><br>FEATURES INCLUDE:<br><br>- sleeps 14<br>- 5 bedrooms<br>- 4.5 baths<br>- outdoor grill<br>- outdoor shower<br>- walking distance to restaurants<br><br>1ST FLOOR<br><br>- open-concept living room, dining room and kitchen (well-stocked for cooking)<br>- half bath<br>- laundry room (w/ two washers and two dryers)<br><br>2ND FLOOR<br><br>- Bedroom 1 - King Master suite with en-suite full bath, double vanity and large walk-in shower<br>- Bedroom 2 - King Master suite with en-suite full bath and walk-in shower<br>- Bedroom 3 - King Master suite with en-suite full bath and walk-in shower<br><br>3RD FLOOR<br><br>- Bedroom 4 - two full beds, en-suite full bath, shower/tub combo<br>- Bunk Room - full bottom bunk, twin top bunk PLUS trundle bed<br><br>RESERVATION / BOOKING POLICY<br><br>• A 50% deposit is due at the time of booking<br><br>• Deposits are fully refundable if cancellations are made more than 30 days prior to check in. Deposits are 50% refundable if cancellation is made less than 30 days but more than 14 days prior to check in. No refunds for cancellations made 14 days or less from check in.<br><br>• Final payment is due 30 days prior to arrival date<br><br>CHECK IN IS 4:00 PM and CHECK OUT IS BY 10:00 AM CST",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Steps to beach, coffee & shopping, 5BR- 3 KING Bed, 6-SEAT GOLF CART, comm. pool"
        }
